cff-version: 1.2.0
# v0.1.0 is a release candidate. date-released is intentionally omitted until an actual release.
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "reproducible-network-pharmacology"
abstract: >-
  A command-line toolkit and agent skill for reproducible network-pharmacology
  analysis: audited parsing and explicit binding of SwissTargetPrediction exports,
  HGNC gene-symbol normalization, compound–target–disease intersection, Cytoscape
  network tables, GO over-representation enrichment via R clusterProfiler with an
  explicit background, deterministic Markdown reports, and per-run provenance.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhu"
    given-names: "Yiming"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zym137706-ops/reproducible-network-pharmacology"
keywords:
  - network pharmacology
  - bioinformatics
  - reproducibility
  - agent skills
  - drug target
